  data: {
    LLM: "Hoard your trumps. If you have the Ace of your suit, it's unbeatable by anyone except... nobody? Actually, if you lead it, someone else might trump it with their trump? No, usually your trump beats their non-trump. Trumps vs Trumps? Usually standard rank.\n\nAttack the Trump: Lead the opponent's trump suit to force them to play high trumps or pick up.\n\nMemory: Know which high cards of your suit are out. If the King is gone, your Queen is boss.",
